<p> The double degree program is a special cooperative  program between  
  PUC-Rio and other institutions (see the list of  institution on the website).  
  The students who have concluded the first two years  at his/her home  
institution can spend two years studying at PUC-Rio  and obtain the two  degrees: one from PUC-Rio and one from his/her home institution.</p>
<p>The international students who participate in this  program are considered to be a part of the exchange program and are subject to  the same rules. Furthermore, as they will obtain a diploma from PUC-Rio, they  must provide the documents 
  &nbsp;listed below  and that they pursue a certain number of obligatory courses, in  particular, disciplines of religious culture (see the statement below).</p>
<p><strong>1. </strong>Documents. In order for the university to be able  to register the students and,  ultimately, give them a diploma, they must provide the following documents,  translated into Portuguese by an official translator.  
  The student should verify whether it is in their  best interest to do the&nbsp;translation  in his/her country or in Brazil.</p>
<ol style="list-style:lower-alpha;">
  <li> Copy of official birth certificate</li>
  <li> Certified copy of Bachelor's degree</li>
  <li> Record of preparatory grades</li>
  <li> Record of grades from the first two years at his/her  home university</li>
  <li> Record of grades from the  Bachelor's degree</li>
<li> and from the last three years of the High School (Not necessary for French institutions)</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>2. </strong>PUC is a  Catholic university. All of the students, independent of their religion, must  obtain a certain number of credits in qualified subjects such as religious  formation. It is impossible to receive a diploma from PUC without satisfying  this condition. It is important that the international students are aware of  this rule.</p>
<p> The following  is the list of mandatory religious culture subjects: </p>
<p>CRE1100 O Homem e o fen&ocirc;meno religioso<br>
  CRE1160 &Eacute;tica Profissional</p>
<p class="puc_texto_destaque_em_quadro_centro">Watch  the video: "Vid&eacute;o d'orientation pour pr&eacute;parer un double
  dipl&ocirc;me &agrave; la PUC-Rio":<br>
  <strong><img src="../imagens/ico_videodownload.png" alt="item" align="absmiddle">&nbsp;<a href="http://midia.puc-rio.br/ensinopesq/ccci/videos/video_ccci_dupla_diplomacao.mp4" target="_blank">Arquivo para download&nbsp;(tamanho: 127Mb)</a><br>
  <img src="../imagens/ico_youtube.png" alt="item" align="absmiddle">&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4HDofryVo4" target="_blank">Youtube</a></strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4HDofryVo4" target="_blank"></a></p>
