<hr>
<a name="internship"></a>

<h4>Internship or Research students </h4>
<p>The Brazilian law requires that students  seeking for internships need to officially be enrolled in a Brazilian  university.  They need to enroll as an  intern-status student at the International Office &ndash; CCCI website and agree to  our terms of applications, as well as sending the required documentation (copy  of passport, letter of recommendation and appointment to the internship etc…)</p>
<p>  In order to help the students in their  registration in a Brazilian institution the Pontifícia Universidade Católica do  Rio de Janeiro – PUC-Rio, accepts the internship/research students nominated  following the requirements below.</p>
<p>  The student  may obtain a student internship in two ways:</p>
<ol class="puc_lista_numeros_TAG-OL">
  <li> Academic  Internship within PUC;</li>
  <li> Academic  Internship outside of PUC with supervision from professors of PUC-Rio.</li>
</ol>


<p class="puc_texto_destaque_em_quadro_centro"><span class="puc_texto_destaque">DEADLINES for submitting  applications:</span><br>
  <strong>  May 15th</strong> (exchange period       starting in Jul-Aug)<br>
  <strong>October 15th</strong> (exchange period starting in Feb/Mar)</p>
<ul class="puc_lista_especial_TAG-UL puc_lista_recuada_TAG-UL">
  <li>Documents:</li>
</ul>
<p>  The  international students must complete the online form and submit all  documentation required as follow:    </p>
<ol class="puc_lista_numeros_TAG-OL">
  <li><strong>Online form: <a href="forms-hp_students.html">http://www.puc-rio.br/ensinopesq/ccci/incoming/forms-hp_students.html</a></strong> - students must fill out the online forms with the &ldquo;<em>Status Estagio</em>&rdquo;.  And send the documents to CCCI Office.<br>
    Interns will be registered as an  internship/research student in our system.</li>
  <li> <strong>Documents:</strong> copy of passport, resume, photo,  letter from the home university stating  that the student is authorized to participate in an internship.</li>
  <li>Official Transcript, Copy of health insurance with company name and policy number covering COVID 19,  a copy of passport (main page), 01 photo (3 cm x 4cm), <strong>Covid 19 Certificate of vaccination (recommended)</strong>,  the administrative cost payment. </li>
  <li> The International Office – (CCCI) will issue a letter of acceptance to the  applicant provided by the professor.</li>
</ol>-->

